"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record for Cumberland County runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids, September to October came in under 90% of normal in 34 of those years, and November to December in 2025 came in at 55% of normal. So far in 2026, March to April sat at 59% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 19079 had its driest year in 2007 at 63% of normal.</p>"}
